{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a52f371e36ba80bff7089905a51dc156","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"islandbride2016\"], I&#039;m give a plus one to the area north of Negril as @[member=\"rachelchic81\"] mentioned. The beaches there are beautiful for a destination wedding in Jamaica.&amp;nbsp; Hotel Riu Palace Tropical Bay &amp;amp; Hotel Riu Negril are at Bloody Bay which is a little more exclusive than the stretch of beach where Sandals Negril Resort &amp;amp; Spa is located. &amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888447,"PostDate":1425566186,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281168\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281168-islandbride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">islandbride2016<\/span><\/a>, I'm give a plus one to the area north of Negril as @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277950\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277950-rachelchic81\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rachelchic81<\/span><\/a> mentioned. The beaches there are beautiful for a destination wedding in Jamaica.\u00a0 Hotel Riu Palace Tropical Bay & Hotel Riu Negril are at Bloody Bay which is a little more exclusive than the stretch of beach where Sandals Negril Resort & Spa is located. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419945157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cd521d3a640b24a7ef3f581873237df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love Secrets in Monetgo Bay you get the perks of 2 resorts St. James and Wild Orchid they share everything pretty much. I went there 2 years ago and it made my choice easy.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890087,"PostDate":1426796301,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love Secrets in Monetgo Bay you get the perks of 2 resorts St. James and Wild Orchid they share everything pretty much. I went there 2 years ago and it made my choice easy.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407436909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.79.44.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5f4c5fd9c360e24be5b35f95ebf68f0","RawContent":"@[member=\"Samantha2015\"]\n\n\nHi Samantha,\n\nCongratulations! I have been looking into Trident Hotel for my wedding next year. What made you choose Trident?","Attachments":[],"Id":1891156,"PostDate":1427598609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281910\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281910-samantha2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Samantha2015<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nHi Samantha,<br>\nCongratulations! I have been looking into Trident Hotel for my wedding next year. What made you choose Trident?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427042404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1444096181","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.26.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c60699f1790c5c595c16f49ace0df7f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Samantha2015\" post=\"1884398\" timestamp=\"1422419319\"]\nTrident Hotel or Strawberry Hills Resort (best locations in my opinion for weddings :) )[\/quote]\nI&#039;ve been looking into trident hotel,  do you have any more info on this resort you can share","Attachments":[],"Id":1893620,"PostDate":1429477269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Samantha2015, on 27 January 2015 - 08:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Trident Hotel or Strawberry Hills Resort (best locations in my opinion for weddings <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> )<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI've been looking into trident hotel,  do you have any more info on this resort you can share\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladylex45@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.26.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429465473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"misamisa","Id":282791,"Name":"misamisa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.98.248.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45a4d63a8a3330cf120a72c52513a3a3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"islandbride2016\" post=\"1878491\" timestamp=\"1416099343\"]\nI just recently got engaged and want to get married in Jamaica. Looking at wedding locations any suggestions?[\/quote]Congrats! I chose Runaway Bay for my August wedding because the beaches are better than in Montego Bay, and there are a lot of attractions nearby in case guests want to venture out and see the island. Prices are also better here too in case you&#039;re on a budget. The resort I went with is Jewel Runaway Bay. They have other Jewel properties too, but I specifically wanted one that accommodated kids. The resort is gorgeous and I can&#039;t wait!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895283,"PostDate":1430756948,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>islandbride2016, on 15 November 2014 - 04:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I just recently got engaged and want to get married in Jamaica. Looking at wedding locations any suggestions?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congrats! I chose Runaway Bay for my August wedding because the beaches are better than in Montego Bay, and there are a lot of attractions nearby in case guests want to venture out and see the island. Prices are also better here too in case you're on a budget. The resort I went with is Jewel Runaway Bay. They have other Jewel properties too, but I specifically wanted one that accommodated kids. The resort is gorgeous and I can't wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashenie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.248.131","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430755382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SashJAbride","Id":282975,"Name":"SashJAbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
