> Time: 1448166861 / Sun, 22 Nov 2015 04:34:21 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=59459&start=60&SessionId=ac586b3e0ceeb4dfda7afa813cbd0d79
> User Toyal (284663)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfa2306e89f8c70948724cee74ec8374","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;I&#039;m so happy that I came across this thread. I understand what you are going through totally. My Fl and I have been together for seven years. I have a now 9 year old going on 10 and he has a 16 year old. we all use to live together in the same city but we are from New Orleans and after hurricane Katrina the Fl ex moved to NC (North Carolina). I feel so sorry for her (my soon to be daughter). Her mother was okay with me dating her ex, but as soon as she found out we were getting married all hell broke lose. &lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;She will not allow her to come visit for the summer or holidays and when the mom comes to town. She tells my Fl he has to go&amp;nbsp;over to his mom house to see her because she will not drop her off at our home. All in all I feel the most bad for my soon to be daughter she is caught in the middle and is 16 and need her father and mother to get along. My Fl talk to his daughter everyday, but I can see he is so hurt&amp;nbsp;by the actions of the ex. I&#039;m thinking about trying to reach out to her. (My Fl ex) I just want us to get along for the sake of my soon to be daughter. I have a daughter that doesn&#039;t have a relationship with her step-mother and I don&#039;t want that to be me and my soon to be daughter becuase I see how it affects my daughter. UGH....&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1440032,"PostDate":1303658844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">I'm so happy that I came across this thread. I understand what you are going through totally. My Fl and I have been together for seven years. I have a now 9 year old going on 10 and he has a 16 year old. we all use to live together in the same city but we are from New Orleans and after hurricane Katrina the Fl ex moved to NC (North Carolina). I feel so sorry for her (my soon to be daughter). Her mother was okay with me dating her ex, but as soon as she found out we were getting married all hell broke lose. <\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">She will not allow her to come visit for the summer or holidays and when the mom comes to town. She tells my Fl he has to go\u00a0over to his mom house to see her because she will not drop her off at our home. All in all I feel the most bad for my soon to be daughter she is caught in the middle and is 16 and need her father and mother to get along. My Fl talk to his daughter everyday, but I can see he is so hurt\u00a0by the actions of the ex. I'm thinking about trying to reach out to her. (My Fl ex) I just want us to get along for the sake of my soon to be daughter. I have a daughter that doesn't have a relationship with her step-mother and I don't want that to be me and my soon to be daughter becuase I see how it affects my daughter. UGH....<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stacey_knockum@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1290380900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nolabride78","Id":234119,"Name":"nolabride78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72f14eff616daf2ab5d7ad69f9473f6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; welcome nolabride :) you do have a tough situation going on, but im confident you can make it work out, you sound like you only wish positive results to happen, so how could it not work out? much luck to you :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; hello ladies, long time to chat! things are a little crazy hectic in our house, SS is involved in varsity soccer as a freshman in high school so needless to say we are trying to adjust to the madness! we are used to chasing him around for club soccer all year but this intense level of sports crammed into 3 months is crazy!! in a great crazy way haha :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; SD is getting a little left behind in her brothers wake, and her mother doesnt really try to single out alone time for the 2 of them (her 3 yr old daughter with a different dude seems to take priority over her other 2 kids, bullcrap!!! they should all be equal) but anyways, DH and i are the only 2 who try to involve her in things but she isnt very motivated to get into activities these days. well, summer is just around the corner so hopefully ill be able to get her on a swim team so she feels a part of something too. i know she feels sad that its always \"brother has a game\" or \"brother has to go to practice\" etc... she wants her own \"thing.\"&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; anyways, hope you all are well! happy easter to you lovely ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1440082,"PostDate":1303667500,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> welcome nolabride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> you do have a tough situation going on, but im confident you can make it work out, you sound like you only wish positive results to happen, so how could it not work out? much luck to you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> hello ladies, long time to chat! things are a little crazy hectic in our house, SS is involved in varsity soccer as a freshman in high school so needless to say we are trying to adjust to the madness! we are used to chasing him around for club soccer all year but this intense level of sports crammed into 3 months is crazy!! in a great crazy way haha <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> SD is getting a little left behind in her brothers wake, and her mother doesnt really try to single out alone time for the 2 of them (her 3 yr old daughter with a different dude seems to take priority over her other 2 kids, bullcrap!!! they should all be equal) but anyways, DH and i are the only 2 who try to involve her in things but she isnt very motivated to get into activities these days. well, summer is just around the corner so hopefully ill be able to get her on a swim team so she feels a part of something too. i know she feels sad that its always \"brother has a game\" or \"brother has to go to practice\" etc... she wants her own \"thing.\"<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> anyways, hope you all are well! happy easter to you lovely ladies!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194486840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ACDCDCAC","Id":207912,"Name":"ACDCDCAC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5564f7ada402e3856ce81a20df75633c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; happy mothers day ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448263,"PostDate":1304874823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> happy mothers day ladies!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194486840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ACDCDCAC","Id":207912,"Name":"ACDCDCAC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bf66740b5862cf53ffbeed5704c5037","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello all!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m new here and it&#039;s so nice to see others are experiencing some of what I am experiencing.&amp;nbsp; In 4 weeks, I am marrying a wonderful man who has 2 children, a boy&amp;nbsp; (15) and a girl (12), from a previous marriage.&amp;nbsp; They live in another state and, with his previous job, he was able to travel to see them more.&amp;nbsp; Coincidentally, since he and I got together, he had to change jobs and can&#039;t travel to see them.&amp;nbsp; It was terrible timing because, of course, it looks like I took him away from them which is the last thing I would do.&amp;nbsp; So, we fly them to stay with us for one week per year (my fiance doesn&#039;t work in the same town where we live and is often in Canada so he&#039;s not home for a week at a time usually).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; His ex-wife has a baby with her boyfriend and has moved on, but seems to rile the kids up at any perceived slight on my or my fiance&#039;s part.&amp;nbsp; For example- I was talking on FB with another friends who is also getting married and I said we are having some close friends and family go with us.&amp;nbsp; She went nuts saying he should consider his children \"close family\".&amp;nbsp; Anyone would see that that is not what I meant, but I&#039;m afraid she&#039;s gotten the kids all excited about something that was never meant to hurt their feelings.&amp;nbsp; They knew we were going to an all-adult resort and we are having a party to celebrate with them and our friends when they are here.&amp;nbsp; I can go on and on.&amp;nbsp; We are both so frustrated.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448878,"PostDate":1304977639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello all!\u00a0 I'm new here and it's so nice to see others are experiencing some of what I am experiencing.\u00a0 In 4 weeks, I am marrying a wonderful man who has 2 children, a boy\u00a0 (15) and a girl (12), from a previous marriage.\u00a0 They live in another state and, with his previous job, he was able to travel to see them more.\u00a0 Coincidentally, since he and I got together, he had to change jobs and can't travel to see them.\u00a0 It was terrible timing because, of course, it looks like I took him away from them which is the last thing I would do.\u00a0 So, we fly them to stay with us for one week per year (my fiance doesn't work in the same town where we live and is often in Canada so he's not home for a week at a time usually).\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> His ex-wife has a baby with her boyfriend and has moved on, but seems to rile the kids up at any perceived slight on my or my fiance's part.\u00a0 For example- I was talking on FB with another friends who is also getting married and I said we are having some close friends and family go with us.\u00a0 She went nuts saying he should consider his children \"close family\".\u00a0 Anyone would see that that is not what I meant, but I'm afraid she's gotten the kids all excited about something that was never meant to hurt their feelings.\u00a0 They knew we were going to an all-adult resort and we are having a party to celebrate with them and our friends when they are here.\u00a0 I can go on and on.\u00a0 We are both so frustrated.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahtacey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1303240074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239054.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SarahTD","Id":239054,"Name":"SarahTD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4733f03785365fab5bcf2402d21e3da3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Aaawww Sarah TD don&#039;t worry they&#039;ll figure it out and see for themselves hopefully sooner than later.&amp;nbsp; We had the same situation and we are planning a AHR for August and to be honest the kids may not even come but the show must go on.&amp;nbsp; I look at it as it&#039;s not my fault that people want to be difficult and cause confusion I can only try and do but so much.&amp;nbsp; Don&#039;t worry maintain you happiness and peace, good luck with everything.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1448924,"PostDate":1304984339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Aaawww Sarah TD don't worry they'll figure it out and see for themselves hopefully sooner than later.\u00a0 We had the same situation and we are planning a AHR for August and to be honest the kids may not even come but the show must go on.\u00a0 I look at it as it's not my fault that people want to be difficult and cause confusion I can only try and do but so much.\u00a0 Don't worry maintain you happiness and peace, good luck with everything.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>4\/1\/11 in St. Kitts at the Marriott I married my best-friend!!!<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"misstiewill@aol.com","IpAddress":"164.82.32.13","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1232017038,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213971.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"big3n09","Id":213971,"Name":"big3n09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51bf6da814819c3063a993d5d0120255","RawContent":"I hope they figure it out soon.  My friend suggested that we do another \"wedding\" at our party so the kids can be there, but I&#039;m not sure they really care about actually seeing us get married or if they&#039;re just feeling left out in general.   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]big3n09[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Aaawww Sarah TD don&#039;t worry they&#039;ll figure it out and see for themselves hopefully sooner than later.  We had the same situation and we are planning a AHR for August and to be honest the kids may not even come but the show must go on.  I look at it as it&#039;s not my fault that people want to be difficult and cause confusion I can only try and do but so much.  Don&#039;t worry maintain you happiness and peace, good luck with everything. \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1449423,"PostDate":1305052254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I hope they figure it out soon. \u00a0My friend suggested that we do another \"wedding\" at our party so the kids can be there, but I'm not sure they really care about actually seeing us get married or if they're just feeling left out in general. \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>big3n09<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Aaawww Sarah TD don't worry they'll figure it out and see for themselves hopefully sooner than later.\u00a0 We had the same situation and we are planning a AHR for August and to be honest the kids may not even come but the show must go on.\u00a0 I look at it as it's not my fault that people want to be difficult and cause confusion I can only try and do but so much.\u00a0 Don't worry maintain you happiness and peace, good luck with everything.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahtacey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1303240074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239054.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SarahTD","Id":239054,"Name":"SarahTD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3cc80eea56a043bb5ee572ab3fc2b5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;  I am Robert,  I don&#039;t have kids yet. I really want 3, but till now nothing...My wife and I, &amp;nbsp;will have 3 &amp;nbsp;&lt;span alt=\":angel:\" id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532752\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532751\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532763\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/plane.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532775\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/neenerneener.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;, no matter how :)  &amp;nbsp;  Our biggest dream is to make them a tree house and a swimming pool in the yard.  Play all 5&amp;nbsp;together.  &amp;nbsp;  Good luck everyone  ____________________________  &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.absoluterv.com\/Garage_Kits.htm\"&gt;Absolute Steel&lt;\/a&gt; - Steel building and carport kits with nationwide jobsite delivery. Easy DIY - America&#039;s easiest to install building system. Watch the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Et5Y0KNj8XE\"&gt;video&lt;\/a&gt; &amp;amp; see for yourself","Attachments":[],"Id":1450546,"PostDate":1305212351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  I am Robert,  I don't have kids yet. I really want 3, but till now nothing...My wife and I, \u00a0will have 3 \u00a0<span alt=\":angel:\" id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532752\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532751\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/><\/span><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532763\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/plane.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532775\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/neenerneener.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; \" \/><\/span>\u00a0, no matter how <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  \u00a0  Our biggest dream is to make them a tree house and a swimming pool in the yard.  Play all 5\u00a0together.  \u00a0  Good luck everyone  ____________________________  <a href='http:\/\/www.absoluterv.com\/Garage_Kits.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Absolute Steel<\/a> - Steel building and carport kits with nationwide jobsite delivery. Easy DIY - America's easiest to install building system. Watch the <a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Et5Y0KNj8XE' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>video<\/a> & see for yourself\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kroberrt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1305210833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kroberrt","Id":239920,"Name":"kroberrt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7e404f46823c61c5452714736be7ff5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422138\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; I am Robert,&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422139\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; I don&#039;t have kids yet. I really want 3, but till now nothing...My wife and I, &amp;nbsp;will have 3 &amp;nbsp;&lt;span id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532752\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"angel1.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532751\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;img alt=\"plane.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532763\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/plane.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"neenerneener.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532775\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/neenerneener.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;, no matter how :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422140\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422141\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Our biggest dream is to make them a tree house and a swimming pool in the yard.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422142\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Play all 5&amp;nbsp;together.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422156\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422157\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; Good luck everyone&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422158\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; ____________________________&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422159\" style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; \"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.absoluterv.com\/Garage_Kits.htm\"&gt;Absolute Steel&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Steel building and carport kits with nationwide jobsite delivery. Easy DIY - America&#039;s easiest to install building system. Watch the&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Et5Y0KNj8XE\"&gt;video&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; see for yourself&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1450548,"PostDate":1305212529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422138\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> I am Robert,<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422139\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> I don't have kids yet. I really want 3, but till now nothing...My wife and I, \u00a0will have 3 \u00a0<span id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532752\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"angel1.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532751\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"plane.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532763\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/plane.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"neenerneener.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532775\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/neenerneener.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span>\u00a0, no matter how <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422140\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422141\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Our biggest dream is to make them a tree house and a swimming pool in the yard.<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422142\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Play all 5\u00a0together.<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422156\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422157\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Good luck everyone<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422158\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> ____________________________<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422159\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.absoluterv.com\/Garage_Kits.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Absolute Steel<\/a>\u00a0- Steel building and carport kits with nationwide jobsite delivery. Easy DIY - America's easiest to install building system. Watch the<a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Et5Y0KNj8XE' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>video<\/a>\u00a0& see for yourself<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kroberrt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1305210833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kroberrt","Id":239920,"Name":"kroberrt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d34f14e89a093811b4a321ccee2b5dbd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\