         <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422138\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> I am Robert,<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422139\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> I don't have kids yet. I really want 3, but till now nothing...My wife and I, \u00a0will have 3 \u00a0<span id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532752\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"angel1.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532751\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/angel1.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"plane.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532763\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/plane.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"neenerneener.gif\" id=\"user_yui_3_3_0_8_130521153532775\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/neenerneener.gif\" style=\"border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; max-width: 100%; height: auto !important; \" \/><\/span>\u00a0, no matter how <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422140\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422141\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Our biggest dream is to make them a tree house and a swimming pool in the yard.<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422142\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Play all 5\u00a0together.<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422156\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422157\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Good luck everyone<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422158\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> ____________________________<\/div> <div id=\"yui_3_3_0_7_1305212428422159\"  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.absoluterv.com\/Garage_Kits.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Absolute Steel<\/a>\u00a0- Steel building and carport kits with nationwide jobsite delivery. Easy DIY - America's easiest to install building system. Watch the<a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Et5Y0KNj8XE' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>video<\/a>\u00a0& see for yourself<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kroberrt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1305210833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239920.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kroberrt","Id":239920,"Name":"kroberrt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":59459,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bad8d336207d262097181dc34d9e7a17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have read through the threads and realize I can add a different twist to the \"stepmom\" title.&amp;nbsp; My FI has three children, 2 girls (8 and 17) and a son (3), &amp;nbsp;as well as a stepson who has raised (13).&amp;nbsp; The girls are both from his first marriage and live in a different city.&amp;nbsp; His son&#039;s mother (also the mother of his stepson) died from cancer shortly before he and I met (they were also married).&amp;nbsp; The kids are great and we get along well.&amp;nbsp; My FI son lives with us and I have been in the picture since he was 1.&amp;nbsp; When FI and I first started dating his widow&#039;s family were not in the picture and the relationship was fractured (I kept telling him ppl grieve in different ways).&amp;nbsp; Now my FI widow&#039;s family lives 15 minutes from us and is in the picture (which I think is great!)...&amp;nbsp; We have had a few family gatherings (one at my house) in which my family, FI family, and FI widow&#039;s family have been in attendance.... Needless to say we are definitely a spin on the Brady Bunch....&amp;nbsp; So my new family will include: FI, 2 daughters, 2 sons, and me....&amp;nbsp; Although it is a bit strange to have your FI ex in-laws present, we think it is necessary because FI youngest son is biracial...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So far things have gone pretty good... Few issues with FI ex in relation to dealing with the kids, but she has done nothing to purposeful to hurt my relationship.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So when you think your situation is rough.... Imagine marrying a widower....&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you think we could have our own reallity show!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1452028,"PostDate":1305484796,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have read through the threads and realize I can add a different twist to the \"stepmom\" title.\u00a0 My FI has three children, 2 girls (8 and 17) and a son (3), \u00a0as well as a stepson who has raised (13).\u00a0 The girls are both from his first marriage and live in a different city.\u00a0 His son's mother (also the mother of his stepson) died from cancer shortly before he and I met (they were also married).\u00a0 The kids are great and we get along well.\u00a0 My FI son lives with us and I have been in the picture since he was 1.\u00a0 When FI and I first started dating his widow's family were not in the picture and the relationship was fractured (I kept telling him ppl grieve in different ways).\u00a0 Now my FI widow's family lives 15 minutes from us and is in the picture (which I think is great!)...\u00a0 We have had a few family gatherings (one at my house) in which my family, FI family, and FI widow's family have been in attendance.... Needless to say we are definitely a spin on the Brady Bunch....\u00a0 So my new family will include: FI, 2 daughters, 2 sons, and me....\u00a0 Although it is a bit strange to have your FI ex in-laws present, we think it is necessary because FI youngest son is biracial...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So far things have gone pretty good... Few issues with FI ex in relation to dealing with the kids, but she has done nothing to purposeful to hurt my relationship.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So when you think your situation is rough.... Imagine marrying a widower....\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you think we could have our own reallity show!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"breathe_again22@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300647815,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237989.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"breathenagain22","Id":237989,"Name":"breathenagain22","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":120,"TotalPages":12,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":110},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
